  "description": "The Stereo 120 Pro 29 sets the standard for comfort, control and agility on the trail. A RockShox Judy Silver fork and Manitou Radium Expert shock take care of bump-smoothing duties, while Magura's light, powerful MT Thirty hydraulic disc brakes work with the tenacious grip of Schwalbe tyres to help keep your speed in check. We chose Sram's NX Eagle 1x12 transmission for its huge range and ease of use, putting the right gear for any trail just a click or two away. It's got the trail smarts to take you further. Are you up for it?",
